  <section class="offer-sec offer-sec--faq" id="faq">
    <div class="offer-head rg-faq__head"><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2></div>
    <div class="rg-faq" data-offer-accordion>
      <div class="rg-faq__col offer-faq">
        <div class="offer-faq__item">
          <button type="button" class="offer-faq__trigger" aria-expanded="false">Does insurance cover this?</button>
          <div class="offer-faq__panel" hidden><div class="offer-faq__body"><p>ReGrip™ is usually a self-pay device — but some private insurers may cover it after individual review.</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="offer-faq__item">
          <button type="button" class="offer-faq__trigger" aria-expanded="false">Why was it created?</button>
          <div class="offer-faq__panel" hidden><div class="offer-faq__body"><p>ReGrip™ was developed to solve a major problem: Most patients stop progressing once therapy sessions end. You need guided movement every day — not once a week. ReGrip™ brings clinic-level hand therapy into the home.</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="offer-faq__item">
          <button type="button" class="offer-faq__trigger" aria-expanded="false">How long does it last?</button>
          <div class="offer-faq__panel" hidden><div class="offer-faq__body"><p>With normal daily use, ReGrip™ is built to last years. The tension system, control module, and tubing are designed for repeated cycles and long-term rehabilitation routines.</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="offer-faq__item">
          <button type="button" class="offer-faq__trigger" aria-expanded="false">Will it help my condition?</button>
          <div class="offer-faq__panel" hidden><div class="offer-faq__body"><p>Yes — that's exactly what it's designed for. ReGrip™ helps with opening/closing stiff fingers, reducing spasticity, improving grip and fine motor control, and rebuilding the brain–hand signal pathway.</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="offer-faq__item">
          <button type="button" class="offer-faq__trigger" aria-expanded="false">Why is it better than alternatives?</button>
          <div class="offer-faq__panel" hidden><div class="offer-faq__body"><p>Alternatives = passive tools. ReGrip™ = active assisted therapy. Alternatives only strengthen muscles you can already use. ReGrip™ rebuilds movement even when the hand is weak, stiff, or not responsive.</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="offer-faq__item">
          <button type="button" class="offer-faq__trigger" aria-expanded="false">What are your return policies?</button>
          <div class="offer-faq__panel" hidden><div class="offer-faq__body"><p>If you're not completely satisfied within the first 30 days, simply return it to us and we'll give you a full refund. You don't have to worry about returning it—we'll take care of that for you!</p></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rg-faq__col offer-faq">
        <div class="offer-faq__item">
          <button type="button" class="offer-faq__trigger" aria-expanded="false">Is it easy to use?</button>
          <div class="offer-faq__panel" hidden><div class="offer-faq__body"><p>Very easy. Designed for seniors, stroke patients, and users with limited mobility. Large buttons, clear display, simple instructions. If you can press one button, you can use it.</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="offer-faq__item">
          <button type="button" class="offer-faq__trigger" aria-expanded="false">When will I see results?</button>
          <div class="offer-faq__panel" hidden><div class="offer-faq__body"><p>Most users feel a difference within 1–3 weeks: reduced stiffness, improved finger mobility, and better control. Longer-term improvements typically appear after 4–8 weeks of daily use.</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="offer-faq__item">
          <button type="button" class="offer-faq__trigger" aria-expanded="false">Do you include extras?</button>
          <div class="offer-faq__panel" hidden><div class="offer-faq__body"><p>Yes. Every order includes: Free digital rehab guide, Free protection case, and Priority Support Access. Occasionally we add limited-time bonuses during promotions.</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="offer-faq__item">
          <button type="button" class="offer-faq__trigger" aria-expanded="false">What makes ReGrip™ different?</button>
          <div class="offer-faq__panel" hidden><div class="offer-faq__body"><p>Most devices rely on self-movement. ReGrip™ assists the entire movement, trains each finger individually, uses structured rehab programs via display, supports neuro-muscular reactivation, and mimics clinic-grade equipment at home.</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="offer-faq__item">
          <button type="button" class="offer-faq__trigger" aria-expanded="false">Can I use ReGrip™ if my hand cannot move at all?</button>
          <div class="offer-faq__panel" hidden><div class="offer-faq__body"><p>Yes. Even if your fingers cannot move voluntarily, the assisted motion can help maintain joint mobility and provide sensory feedback to the brain.</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="offer-faq__item">
          <button type="button" class="offer-faq__trigger" aria-expanded="false">How do I get in touch?</button>
